# Pipeline runtime state — local-only, never commit (#48, #85)
# The directory's runtime files, not the tracked .pipeline/verify.tsv registry:
# the pipeline also writes probe scripts and evidence captures under
# .pipeline/probes, and a blanket `git add -A` would publish them.
.pipeline/*
!.pipeline/verify.tsv
.pipeline-lock
LEDGER.tsv

